        "text": "It seems like only yesterday you were swaddling your little one...and now he's on his way to school. And while he's learning his ABCs, you'll be learning how to adjust to a new schedule. Read on for tips on better ways to get your preschooler ready in the a.m. (without rushing!) and what to pack in that in that cuter-than-cute lunch box.",
